      "node_id": "kg_doc_6",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Alison Brie Schermerhorn (born December 29, 1982 ) is an American actress and producer. She portrayed Annie Edison in the NBC/Yahoo! sitcom \"Community\" (2009–2015) and Trudy Campbell in the AMC drama \"Mad Men\" (2007–2015). Brie currently voices Diane Nguyen on the Netflix animated series \"BoJack Horseman\" (2014–present) and portrays Ruth Wilder on the Netflix comedy-drama series \"GLOW\" (2017). She has starred in several films, such as \"Scream 4\" (2011), \"The Five-Year Engagement\" (2012), \"The Lego Movie\" (2014), \"Get Hard\" (2015), \"Sleeping with Other People\" (2015), and \"How to Be Single\" (2016).",
